      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003ETo make an Outlandish dish.\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\nTake the liver of a Hogg, and cut it in small pieces about the bigness of a span, then take Anni-seed, or French-seed, Pepper and Salt, and season them therewithall, and lay every piece severally round in the caule of the Hogg, and so roast them on a Bird-Spit.\u003Cbr\u003E"
